# ==============================================================================
# NASA Earth System Trend Detective — Environment Configuration Example
# ==============================================================================
# This project is a pure static web application for Vercel deployment.
# The frontend client runs entirely in the browser and does NOT require any secrets.
#
# If you run the offline data verification script (`fetch_nasa_cmr.py`) locally
# or in CI/CD, set your NASA Earthdata Login Bearer token here:
NASA_EARTHDATA_TOKEN=

